  "description": "Ye-Ju, an ordinary alpha college student, is cast into another world—mistaken for a slave and claimed by a nobleman. But the task awaiting him is not labor. As the nobleman’s true nature begins to surface, Ye-Ju finds himself trapped between desire, danger, and a longing to return home.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
